      "height": 120,
      "content": "BrowserSkills UI. One accent (teal 14B8A6), solid base 14171C, translucent panels with blur, no gradients, no drop shadows except the toast. Geist stands in for SF Pro; the app uses the system font. Three states: browse with repeat toast, skills panel open, teaching."
